#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Typed CLI for the local Relate by Neo4j graphs (connector custom.relate).

The Relate HTTP Query API needs no credential. Each graph is served by its
own `relate serve` process bound to loopback, and the graphs registry at
~/workspace/relate-space/graphs/registry.json is the source of truth for
which graphs exist and where they answer.

Every subcommand prints JSON to stdout. Errors go to stderr with a
non-zero exit code.
"""

